        "excerpt": "In the early stages of an inheritance procedure in Japan, the key is to confirm who the heirs are and what assets exist. This article explains how to proceed with heir identification and asset investigation, the wide-area family register certificate delivery that began in 2024, and what an administrative scrivener can handle.",
