        "excerpt": "A holograph will and a notarised will differ in form, whether probate is required, and cost. Under current law a holograph will must be entirely handwritten and sealed. This article also covers the Legal Affairs Bureau custody system begun in 2020, the digitalisation of notarial practice in 2025, and the 2026 amendments that are promulgated but not yet in force.",
